thrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{2}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{9 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\arctan{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "9bb2adca-9b51-5978-86ac-fa775e6a5e4d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "9bb2adca-9b51-5978-86ac-fa775e6a5e4d" :question/answer-fields "c372854f-3445-5297-a2e4-35638751a404"] [:db/ensure "9bb2adca-9b51-5978-86ac-fa775e6a5e4d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "9bb2adca-9b51-5978-86ac-fa775e6a5e4d"] [:db/add "1f6d733a-ae34-5a83-9bdb-fffcf8504977" :answer/id #uuid "1f6d733a-ae34-5a83-9bdb-fffcf8504977"] [:db/add "1f6d733a-ae34-5a83-9bdb-fffcf8504977" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1f6d733a-ae34-5a83-9bdb-fffcf8504977" :answer/value "- \\frac{4 \\arctan{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "1f6d733a-ae34-5a83-9bdb-fffcf8504977" :answer/validate] [:db/add "14b7e2e5-c38f-5e70-8679-39111de42aff" :answer/id #uuid "14b7e2e5-c38f-5e70-8679-39111de42aff"] [:db/add "14b7e2e5-c38f-5e70-8679-39111de42aff" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "14b7e2e5-c38f-5e70-8679-39111de42aff" :answer/value "\\frac{8 \\arctan{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "14b7e2e5-c38f-5e70-8679-39111de42aff" :answer/validate] [:db/add "69ebc231-4735-5b38-b79b-c02ee3b96399" :answer/id #uuid "69ebc231-4735-5b38-b79b-c02ee3b96399"] [:db/add "69ebc231-4735-5b38-b79b-c02ee3b96399" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "69ebc231-4735-5b38-b79b-c02ee3b96399" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)