oblem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{9 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "366d21d4-62b8-54fa-949c-51aee722e657" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{4}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{9 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4 \\arctan{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "366d21d4-62b8-54fa-949c-51aee722e657" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "366d21d4-62b8-54fa-949c-51aee722e657" :question/answer-fields "06cc5271-54c4-5c83-bc5d-a9c7fc78f34a"] [:db/ensure "366d21d4-62b8-54fa-949c-51aee722e657" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "366d21d4-62b8-54fa-949c-51aee722e657"] [:db/add "dfa4fe20-07c8-5475-b6c6-780956c8c966" :answer/id #uuid "dfa4fe20-07c8-5475-b6c6-780956c8c966"] [:db/add "dfa4fe20-07c8-5475-b6c6-780956c8c966" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "dfa4fe20-07c8-5475-b6c6-780956c8c966" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "dfa4fe20-07c8-5475-b6c6-780956c8c966" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a79e726d-3551-581c-9d81-dde515b6a855" :answer/id #uuid "a79e726d-3551-581c-9d81-dde515b6a855"] [:db/add "a79e726d-3551-581c-9d81-dde515b6a855" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a79e726d-3551-581c-9d81-dde515b6a855" :answer/value "\\arctan{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "a79e726d-3