athrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot 2=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e67daad2-4eb1-599e-ad0c-33dc5036337d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "e67daad2-4eb1-599e-ad0c-33dc5036337d" :question/answer-fields "4fdc3313-e82f-5314-a725-4ffa5fbda3ad"] [:db/ensure "e67daad2-4eb1-599e-ad0c-33dc5036337d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "e67daad2-4eb1-599e-ad0c-33dc5036337d"] [:db/add "16d1a3f9-0268-598a-8074-7dfe2e15438f" :answer/id #uuid "16d1a3f9-0268-598a-8074-7dfe2e15438f"] [:db/add "16d1a3f9-0268-598a-8074-7dfe2e15438f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "16d1a3f9-0268-598a-8074-7dfe2e15438f" :answer/value "- \\frac{2 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "16d1a3f9-0268-598a-8074-7dfe2e15438f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "02f10cce-e083-55dd-b805-a804ad190946" :answer/id #uuid "02f10cce-e083-55dd-b805-a804ad190946"] [:db/add "02f10cce-e083-55dd-b805-a804ad190946" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "02f10cce-e083-55dd-b805-a804ad190946" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "02f10cce-e083-55dd-b805-a804ad190946" :answer/validate] [:db/add "304012d6-2a74-5a3a-9f0d-ad4af63b14fe" :answer/id #uuid "304012d6-2a74-5a3a-9f0d-ad4af63b14fe"] [:db/add "304012d6-2a74-5a3a-9f0d-ad4af63b14fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "304012d6-2a74-5a3a-9f0d-ad4af63b14fe" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}}{9}+C"] [:db/ensure "304012d6-2a74-5a3a-9f0d-ad4a