 \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "046c3079-1554-5571-917c-f42710075682" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 9=9\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot 3=\\frac{2}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "046c3079-1554-5571-917c-f42710075682" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "046c3079-1554-5571-917c-f42710075682" :question/answer-fields "fe214b1e-c308-536a-af34-01231d7acfdf"] [:db/ensure "046c3079-1554-5571-917c-f42710075682" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "046c3079-1554-5571-917c-f42710075682"] [:db/add "5982aa69-c727-54e8-abf5-64c583c29267" :answer/id #uuid "5982aa69-c727-54e8-abf5-64c583c29267"] [:db/add "5982aa69-c727-54e8-abf5-64c583c29267" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5982aa69-c727-54e8-abf5-64c583c29267" :answer/value "2 \\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "5982aa69-c727-54e8-abf5-64c583c29267" :answer/validate] [:db/add "67e5409e-d558-53d8-a1ff-dd079974dccc" :answer/id #uuid "67e5409e-d558-53d8-a1ff-dd079974dccc"] [:db/add "67e5409e-d558-53d8-a1ff-dd079974dccc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "67e5409e-d558-53d8-a1ff-dd079974dccc" :answer/value "\\arctan{\\left(\