db/add "f08505b8-4727-58a4-8c08-4c0fee0c0358" :answer-field/correct "67e5409e-d558-53d8-a1ff-dd079974dccc"] [:db/ensure "f08505b8-4727-58a4-8c08-4c0fee0c0358" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2a65b5f7-9d91-504f-a06b-aaa4ac2f0122" :question/id #uuid "2a65b5f7-9d91-504f-a06b-aaa4ac2f0122"] [:db/add "2a65b5f7-9d91-504f-a06b-aaa4ac2f0122" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "2a65b5f7-9d91-504f-a06b-aaa4ac2f0122" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 16=16\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 4=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "2a65b5f7-9d91-504f-a06b-aaa4ac2f0122" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "2a65b5f7-9d91-504f-a06b-aaa4ac2f0122" :question/answer-fields "f08505b8-4727-58a4-8c08-4c0fee0c0358"] [:db/ensure "2a65b5f7-9d91-504f-a06b-aaa4ac2f0122" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "2a65b5f7-9d91-504f-a06b-aaa4ac2f0122"] [:db/add "68ca1c77-fbb4-55c8-a6de-495b090fd902" :answer/id #uuid "68ca1c77-fbb4-55c8-a6de-495b090fd902"] [:db/add "68ca1c77-fbb4-55c8-a6de-495b090fd902" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "68ca1c77-fbb4-55c8-a6de-495b090fd902" :answer/value "\\frac{8 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{6} \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "68ca1c7