s "d5fb9f79-b975-505c-acd9-847721cb0a57"] [:db/add "72726623-71c9-56bf-9e8a-0dff6efc2a5f" :answer-field/choices "30e2130e-2e4e-535a-8f68-09b6fcb9b8bb"] [:db/add "72726623-71c9-56bf-9e8a-0dff6efc2a5f" :answer-field/choices "09954c7a-2326-5f64-a925-6a550d611300"] [:db/add "72726623-71c9-56bf-9e8a-0dff6efc2a5f" :answer-field/choices "c9926cb8-91aa-5ea4-ab21-26f0e1f0dc0a"] [:db/add "72726623-71c9-56bf-9e8a-0dff6efc2a5f" :answer-field/correct "09954c7a-2326-5f64-a925-6a550d611300"] [:db/ensure "72726623-71c9-56bf-9e8a-0dff6efc2a5f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b442a1fa-0ba6-5561-87b5-e61b2cab5ed5" :question/id #uuid "b442a1fa-0ba6-5561-87b5-e61b2cab5ed5"] [:db/add "b442a1fa-0ba6-5561-87b5-e61b2cab5ed5" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "b442a1fa-0ba6-5561-87b5-e61b2cab5ed5" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 9=9\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{4}{9}\\cdot 3=\\frac{4}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "b442a1fa-0ba6-5561-87b5-e61b2cab5ed5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "b442a1fa-0ba6-5561-87b5-e61b2cab5ed5" :question/answer-fields "72726623-71c9-56bf-9e8a-0dff6efc2a5f"] [:db/ensure