$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "ee8614b1-724a-5ab7-bc81-4b936c05df1a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "ee8614b1-724a-5ab7-bc81-4b936c05df1a" :question/answer-fields "095565ed-6d46-5a8f-8b00-08b88320aee8"] [:db/ensure "ee8614b1-724a-5ab7-bc81-4b936c05df1a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "ee8614b1-724a-5ab7-bc81-4b936c05df1a"] [:db/add "aa7022a6-11f7-5a7a-b947-4b27582eb0ea" :answer/id #uuid "aa7022a6-11f7-5a7a-b947-4b27582eb0ea"] [:db/add "aa7022a6-11f7-5a7a-b947-4b27582eb0ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "aa7022a6-11f7-5a7a-b947-4b27582eb0ea" :answer/value "\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "aa7022a6-11f7-5a7a-b947-4b27582eb0ea" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ed0a1220-6d75-56aa-a4d0-7a93088e90a4" :answer/id #uuid "ed0a1220-6d75-56aa-a4d0-7a93088e90a4"] [:db/add "ed0a1220-6d75-56aa-a4d0-7a93088e90a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ed0a1220-6d75-56aa-a4d0-7a93088e90a4" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}}{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "ed0a1220-6d75-56aa-a4d0-7a93088e90a4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "effd7907-54b3-5254-b573-307dbbd3a259" :answer/id #uuid "effd7907-54b3-5254-b573-307dbbd3a259"] [:db/add "effd7907-54b3-5254-b573-307dbbd3a259" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "effd7907-54b3-5254-b573-307dbbd3a259" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{6} \\right)}}{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "effd7907-54b3-5254-b573-30