9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "08808a54-3c5c-5fcc-8219-93414d371bab" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 9=9\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot 3=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "08808a54-3c5c-5fcc-8219-93414d371bab" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "08808a54-3c5c-5fcc-8219-93414d371bab" :question/answer-fields "24ec913b-1c30-513f-8df0-66db690316b4"] [:db/ensure "08808a54-3c5c-5fcc-8219-93414d371bab" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "08808a54-3c5c-5fcc-8219-93414d371bab"] [:db/add "13704a66-8a0b-50bf-b31d-a14379418722" :answer/id #uuid "13704a66-8a0b-50bf-b31d-a14379418722"] [:db/add "13704a66-8a0b-50bf-b31d-a14379418722" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "13704a66-8a0b-50bf-b31d-a14379418722" :answer/value "3 \\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "13704a66-8a0b-50bf-b31d-a14379418722" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bb502b40-b547-5f12-a01b-45eebf7f6c47" :answer/id #uuid "bb502b40-b547-5f12-a01b-45eebf7f6c47"] [:db/add "bb502b40-b547-5f12-a01b-45eebf7f6c47" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "bb502b40-b547-5f12-a01b-45eebf7f6c47" :answer/value "3 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "bb502b40-b547-5f12-a01b-45eebf7f6c47" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3836ee0c-3d23-549