r-field/choices "c696b9a5-a2aa-5a2a-8dec-7ad8d4cff5be"] [:db/add "246dd6bc-5896-51cb-8976-0e0583e515c0" :answer-field/choices "f13bca80-8c18-582d-b5a4-6bed2c52319e"] [:db/add "246dd6bc-5896-51cb-8976-0e0583e515c0" :answer-field/choices "3aa0d53d-3df1-52d2-81c7-2019086a278c"] [:db/add "246dd6bc-5896-51cb-8976-0e0583e515c0" :answer-field/choices "da42d7f7-9c73-5ee2-97c2-644012044c30"] [:db/add "246dd6bc-5896-51cb-8976-0e0583e515c0" :answer-field/correct "da42d7f7-9c73-5ee2-97c2-644012044c30"] [:db/ensure "246dd6bc-5896-51cb-8976-0e0583e515c0" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "45ebda02-1c0c-5192-b4c8-f1d420459040" :question/id #uuid "45ebda02-1c0c-5192-b4c8-f1d420459040"] [:db/add "45ebda02-1c0c-5192-b4c8-f1d420459040" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{9 x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "45ebda02-1c0c-5192-b4c8-f1d420459040" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{3 x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{3}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n9 x^{2} + 4=4\\left(1+(\\frac{3 x}{2})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot \\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{2}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{9 x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "45ebda02-1c0c-5192-b4c8-f1d420459040" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "45ebda02-1c0c-5192-b4c8-f1d420459040" :question/answer-fields "246dd6bc-5896-51cb-8976-0e0583e515c0"] [:db/ensure "45ebda02-1c0c-5192-b4c8-f1d420459040" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "45ebda02-1c0c-5192-b4c8-f1d420459040"] [:db/add "137b46e8-1461-5e66-baf0-d7fd8af41ab6" :answer/id #uuid "137b46e8-1461-5e66-baf0-d7fd8af41ab6"] [:db/add "137b46e8-1461-5e66-baf0-d7fd8af41ab6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "137b46e8-1461-5e66-baf0-d7fd8af41ab6" :answer/value "3 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{2} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "137b46e8-1461-5e66-baf0-d7fd8af41ab6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "facd0287-9e6e-5fce-b35e-ab1386248839" :answer/id #uuid "facd0287-9e6e-5fce-b35e-ab1386248839"] [:db/add "facd0287-9e6e-5fce-b35e-ab1386248839" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "facd0287-9e6e-5fce-b35e-ab1386248839" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "facd0287-9e6e-5fce-b35e-ab1386248839" :answer/validate] [:db/add "67c2bbe9-16c8-5814-9dee-b90373df67bb" :answer/id #uuid "67c2bbe9-16c8-5814-9dee-b90373df67bb"] [:db/add "67c2bbe9-16c8-5814-9dee-b90373df67bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "67c2bbe9-16c8-5814-9dee-b90373df67bb" :answer/value "\\frac{15 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{2} \\right)}}{8}+C"] [:db/ensure "67c2bbe9-16c8-5814-9dee-b90373df67bb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "50e6a48e-bd17-5983-bafd-4bbb69847374" :answer/id #uuid "50e6a48e-bd17-5983-bafd-4bbb69847374"] [:db/add "50e6a48e-bd17-5983-bafd-4bbb69847374" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "50e6a48e-bd17-5983-bafd-4bbb69847374" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{2} \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "50e6a48e-bd17-5983-bafd-4bbb69847374" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ba779c7f-ff57-52f3-8bff-d9b54db75e07" :answer/id #uuid "ba779c7f-ff57-52f3-8bff-d9b54db75e07"] [:db/add "ba779c7f-ff57-52f3-8bff-d9b54db75e07" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ba779c7f-ff57-52f3-8bff-d9b54db75e07" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{2} \\right)}}{10}+C"] [:db/ensure "ba779c7f-ff57-52f3-