thrm{d}u=(\\frac{5}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n25 x^{2} + 4=4\\left(1+(\\frac{5 x}{2})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{2}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{2}{5}=\\frac{1}{10}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{25 x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{10}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{10}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{10}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{2} \\right)}}{10}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "ed1aad87-6f1b-5e6d-85d3-7199d0489c00" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "ed1aad87-6f1b-5e6d-85d3-7199d0489c00" :question/answer-fields "75b82ac8-5759-500e-aa6a-2ba7a9c52492"] [:db/ensure "ed1aad87-6f1b-5e6d-85d3-7199d0489c00" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "ed1aad87-6f1b-5e6d-85d3-7199d0489c00"] [:db/add "7abb29b8-e6c4-573a-8e12-1348b82ba603" :answer/id #uuid "7abb29b8-e6c4-573a-8e12-1348b82ba603"] [:db/add "7abb29b8-e6c4-573a-8e12-1348b82ba603" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7abb29b8-e6c4-573a-8e12-1348b82ba603" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}}{4}+C"] [:db/ensure "7abb29b8-e6c4-573a-8e12-1348b82ba603" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4e0cf482-67e1-5f33-9e7f-ddd628f5d85d" :answer/id #uuid "4e0cf482-67e1-5f33-9e7f-ddd628f5d85d"] [:db/add "4e0cf482-67e1-5f33-9e7f-ddd628f5d85d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4e0cf482-67e1-5f33-9e7f-ddd628f5d85d" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "4e0cf482-67e1-5f33-9e7f-ddd628f5d85d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "524e834b-c9da-58c9-ab26-947f6a61d63b" :answer/id #uuid "524e834b-c9d