abaa-207527472585" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1ca21dbd-99f6-5e93-87cc-7064f9fb45bb" :question/id #uuid "1ca21dbd-99f6-5e93-87cc-7064f9fb45bb"] [:db/add "1ca21dbd-99f6-5e93-87cc-7064f9fb45bb" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{9 x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "1ca21dbd-99f6-5e93-87cc-7064f9fb45bb" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{3 x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{3}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n9 x^{2} + 4=4\\left(1+(\\frac{3 x}{2})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{1}{6}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{9 x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}}{6}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "1ca21dbd-99f6-5e93-87cc-7064f9fb45bb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "1ca21dbd-99f6-5e93-87cc-7064f9fb45bb" :question/answer-fields "bc56f76f-d5e0-5f16-abaa-207527472585"] [:db/ensure "1ca21dbd-99f6-5e93-87cc-7064f9fb45bb" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "1ca21dbd-99f6-5e93-87cc-7064f9fb45bb"] [:db/add "47c89209-43c7-5c41-976b-1fe1e6785559" :answer/id #uuid "47c89209-43c7-5c41-976b-1fe1e6785559"] [:db/add "47c89209-43c7-5c41-976b-1fe1e6785559" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "47c89209-43c7-5c41-976b-1fe1e6785559" :answer/value "3 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{3} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "47c89209-43c7-5c41-976b-1fe