le:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{10}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{10}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{4} \\right)}}{10}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "5b19267e-e432-50cb-95e6-a6fcf473ebd2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "5b19267e-e432-50cb-95e6-a6fcf473ebd2" :question/answer-fields "5f848af2-c4f9-5874-acf9-c5daa3397953"] [:db/ensure "5b19267e-e432-50cb-95e6-a6fcf473ebd2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "5b19267e-e432-50cb-95e6-a6fcf473ebd2"] [:db/add "5664d1b9-8cc6-5ca7-be1a-79c3c839e2f4" :answer/id #uuid "5664d1b9-8cc6-5ca7-be1a-79c3c839e2f4"] [:db/add "5664d1b9-8cc6-5ca7-be1a-79c3c839e2f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5664d1b9-8cc6-5ca7-be1a-79c3c839e2f4" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{6} \\right)}}{15}+C"] [:db/ensure "5664d1b9-8cc6-5ca7-be1a-79c3c839e2f4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2da36e67-17e0-50c1-a7c2-4b11065f0e00" :answer/id #uuid "2da36e67-17e0-50c1-a7c2-4b11065f0e00"] [:db/add "2da36e67-17e0-50c1-a7c2-4b11065f0e00" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2da36e67-17e0-50c1-a7c2-4b11065f0e00" :answer/value "2 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{3} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "2da36e67-17e0-50c1-a7c2-4b11065f0e00" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c2e253d0-cad7-561b-9ba5-1931ef59fde0" :answer/id #uuid "c2e253d0-cad7-561b-9ba5-1931ef59fde0"] [:db/add "c2e253d0-cad7-561b-9ba5-1931ef59fde0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c2e253d0-cad7-561b-9ba5-1931ef59fde0" :answer/value "\\frac{10 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{3} \\right)}}{27}+C"] [:db/ensure "c2e253d0-cad7-561b-9ba5-1931ef59fde0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "370910d2-7235-51b0-9924-fdad8645e1db" :answer/id #uuid "370910d2-7235-51b0-9924-fdad8645e1db"] [:db/add "370910d2-7235-51b0-9924-fdad8645e1db" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3