. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{5}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n25 x^{2} + 9=9\\left(1+(\\frac{5 x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{3}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot \\frac{3}{5}=\\frac{2}{15}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{25 x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{15}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{15}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2}{15}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{3} \\right)}}{15}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "cb33b702-d988-53f0-b6be-9b188cd73b91" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "cb33b702-d988-53f0-b6be-9b188cd73b91" :question/answer-fields "fef051a6-397e-5351-a9fa-77a1bbe4b801"] [:db/ensure "cb33b702-d988-53f0-b6be-9b188cd73b91" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "cb33b702-d988-53f0-b6be-9b188cd73b91"] [:db/add "475bf648-0807-5f25-ba08-3d4d195c7a2d" :answer/id #uuid "475bf648-0807-5f25-ba08-3d4d195c7a2d"] [:db/add "475bf648-0807-5f25-ba08-3d4d195c7a2d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "475bf648-0807-5f25-ba08-3d4d195c7a2d" :answer/value "\\frac{15 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{4} \\right)}}{64}+C"] [:db/ensure "475bf648-0807-5f25-ba08-3d4d195c7a2d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6804147d-4329-5d70-aff0-67a40bb6064b" :answer/id #uuid "6804147d-4329-5d70-aff0-67a40bb6064b"] [:db/add "6804147d-4329-5d70-aff0-67a40bb6064b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6804147d-4329-5d70-aff0-67a40bb6064b" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}}{40}+C"] [:db/ensure "6804147d-4329-5d70-aff0-67a40bb6064b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0c450210-b64f-5c81-addf-059a92699486" :answer/i