:db/ensure "91722231-d6f4-51e6-8c12-4a8be77abfcf" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c10273d4-5112-5ca8-8840-456b02f75ed5" :question/id #uuid "c10273d4-5112-5ca8-8840-456b02f75ed5"] [:db/add "c10273d4-5112-5ca8-8840-456b02f75ed5" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3}{25 x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "c10273d4-5112-5ca8-8840-456b02f75ed5" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{5 x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{5}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n25 x^{2} + 16=16\\left(1+(\\frac{5 x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{4}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{16}\\cdot \\frac{4}{5}=\\frac{3}{20}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{25 x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{20}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{20}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{20}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 \\arctan{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{4} \\right)}}{20}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "c10273d4-5112-5ca8-8840-456b02f75ed5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "c10273d4-5112-5ca8-8840-456b02f75ed5" :question/answer-fields "91722231-d6f4-51e6-8c12-4a8be77abfcf"] [:db/ensure "c10273d4-5112-5ca8-8840-456b02f75ed5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "c10273d4-5112-5ca8-8840-456b02f75ed5"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "f73c78b7-abe9-5a8d-992b-e35e81b69b56"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/79/7993c20342fd74cb46c965732b8711d8145e5c405403ceb591f93025576ad0a2/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/question-genera